# GF Board Kiosk Application

## Project Overview
A React + TypeScript + Cloudflare Workers kiosk application for gym displays.

## Tech Stack
- React 19.1.1 with TypeScript
- Vite 7.1.2 for build tooling
- Cloudflare Workers for backend
- Tailwind CSS v4 for styling
- Zustand for state management
- OPFS-tools for file storage

## Architecture
- Frontend: React SPA with two main views
- Backend: Cloudflare Workers API
- Storage: OPFS for offline media caching
- Media Source: Google Drive integration

## Key Features
- Gym location selection (hardcoded initially)
- Google Drive folder sync (shared + location-specific)
- OPFS media storage and caching
- Slideshow functionality for images/videos

## Development Patterns
- Component-based architecture
- State management with Zustand
- OPFS for offline-first media storage
- Responsive design for kiosk displays
